he comorbidities that you've heard  about people with pre-existing health  conditions but there are young people  that are getting sicker than others so  so why do some people have milder  illness than others certainly there's a  lot of anxiety and worry about lack of  other treatments this being so novel and  then not having a vaccine and so the big  question is how do you safely start  decreasing some of the measures that the  tightness on the measures that we have  in the community to allow some of that  normalcy to come back as the weeks and  months progress and how are we going to  know that we're doing that safely so  we're not putting ourselves again at  risk of  second surge as we call it
 

